@startuml F4.1a-carregar-pool-caaf
title F4.1a — Carregar pool CAAF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CAAFController" as Ctrl
participant "GetCAAFDashboardUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: /comissoes/caaf
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /comissoes/caaf
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT KPIs + pool\n(escopo curso)
Postgres --> UC: dados
UC --> Ctrl: dashboard + _links
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: KPIs e tabela

@enduml
